chrome.holy.jp/commission/a01.jpg\nhttp://monochrome.holy.jp/commission/a02.png\n※紫の瞳のキャラクターです。\n\n●衣装、配色資料：\nhttp://monochrome.holy.jp/commission/a00.jpg\n※獣耳と尻尾は無視してください。通常は普通の人間です。\n※衣装については左耳の耳飾りを除き、自由にアレンジ、装飾の追加/削除をしていただいて構いません。(耳飾りも金具部分は形状自由です)\n\n宛名はpsdで表示/非表示切り替え可能だとありがたいです。\n変なリクエストだな…という自覚はあるのですが、なにとぞご検討よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 663892, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "コバヤシ⁉️", "screen_name": "iaia_58", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1879864942024916993/qF118kpe.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1668309895777763328/1759167662/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 20, "complete_expiration_days": 50, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 1163368, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ﾅﾂﾊﾞ", "screen_name": "Natsuba002", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1412134279908249617/4aIQ2lL3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1358074305658068994/1637109599/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 1462809, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Soe【連載中･デスレスブライド】", "screen_name": "Soe_chimi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1408404306487697414/vFdj7f4V.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/972869541645570048/1646330200/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": n